{"title":"机构/自然人主体删除","icon":"","img":"","tags":"","hideInMenu":"false","text":"module","cls":"Wb.Module","properties":{"cid":"module","serverScript":"let data_status = Wb.get('DATA_STATUS');\n\n// 在初次填报 新增页面点“取消”时删除临时表所有关联人数据 避免污染正式表数据\nif (data_status === '0') {\n  Wb.sendRowx(`delete from thjs.t_th_relat_info_tmp where client_id = {?CLIENT_ID?}`)\n} else {\n  // 初次填报新增页面 关联人做了去重展示，点击对应关联人的“删除”按钮需删除该客户所有名为该related_name的关联人数据\n  Wb.sql({ sql: `delete from thjs.t_th_relat_info_tmp where client_id = {?CLIENT_ID?} and related_name = {?RELATED_NAME?}` });\n  Wb.sql({ sql: `delete from thjs.t_th_relat_info where client_id = {?CLIENT_ID?} and related_name = {?RELATED_NAME?}` })\n}"},"_icon":"module"}